# 💼 Project Title: Improving Internet Sales with Dashboards

## 📊 Description
**Optimizing Travel Package Performance, Customer Satisfaction Analysis & improving Data Collection**

## ✅ Project Flow
1. Business Requirements      
2. Data Creation                    
3. Data Transformation              
4. Data Validation / QA             
5. Upload to GCS                    
6. Query Analysis                   
7. Data Dictionary / Docs           
8. EDA                              
9. Power BI Dashboard               
10. KPI Dashboard / Summary Page     
11. Insight Log / Journal           
12. Report Writing (Word/PDF)       
13. Presentation Slide (PPT/Prezi)  
14. Business Recommendations Slide  
15. What-If / Scenario Modelling    
16. Hypothesis Testing              
17. Executive Summary Slide         
18. GitHub Repository               
19. DAG / Automation Plan           
20. User Stories / Use Case Mapping 

## 📂 Repository Structure
- `data/` – Raw and processed datasets
- `sql/` – SQL queries for transformation & analysis
- `docs/` – Data dictionary and validation
- `notebook/` – hypothesis testing, what-if analysis 
- `dashboard/` – Power BI dashboard files
- `reports/` – Final report & slides
- `insights.md` – Business insights and logs

## Tools Used
- Google BigQuery
- Power BI
- Google Cloud Storage
- SQL / Python
- VS Code

